      "title": "Dedup tickets on save",
      "url": "https://github.com/acme/helpdesk/pull/128",
      "source": "fix/ticket-dedup",
      "target": "main",
      "description": "A double click on Save created two tickets. The form now sends a dedup key, and the API returns the ticket it already created."
    },
    "summary": "Pressing **Save** twice, or a retried request, created duplicate tickets. The form now sends one **dedup key** per form, disables Save while saving, and the API returns the existing ticket for a repeated key within ten seconds.",
